s to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/5c8f3447c4da9136f587cbc46379f59b.poster.avif?t=1772646976\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/5c8f3447c4da9136f587cbc46379f59b.webm?t=1772646976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/5c8f3447c4da9136f587cbc46379f59b.mp4?t=1772646976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/83bf5d4b80af2fa6f9d8ffedbfe8b0f8.webp?t=1772646976\" width=135 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A close clash with a troll cannot end well, especially for small creatures such as dwarves. A tall structure called a tower comes to the rescue. You can drop almost anything on enemy heads.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you throw a stone? You can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you throw an axe? You can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you throw a goat? Of course you can! The question is - is it worth it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/9bbeaef91f74daa92a9489a827036724.poster.avif?t=1772646976\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540060/extras/9bbeaef91f74daa92a9489a827036724.webm?t=1772646976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/254006